    "text": "Sonali Bendre Exclusive: On The Happy Pawdcast 2, Post-Cancer Recovery, Parenthood, Son Ranveer;N18V\nMovies\nIn an exclusive chat with CNN-News18 Showsha's Titas Chowdhury, Sonali Bendre talks about the second season of her podcast, The Happy Pawdcast, that explores pet parenting. She speaks of the love she received from her own pet dog following her cancer treatment and also spills the beans on navigating the challenges of being a parent to a 20-year-old son in this digital age and reveals if he intends on becoming an actor. She further recalls how she received flak when she decided to foray into TV after doing films like Duplicate and Sarfarosh.\nLast Updated: November 06, 2025, 10:51 ISTAdvertisement\nmore Videos\nFollow News18 on Google. Join the fun, play\nQIK games on News18. Download the\nNews18 Appto stay updated.",
